<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Sales Letter</title>

    <style>
        body{
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background:#f4f4f4;
            margin:0;
            padding:0;
        }

        .container{
            width:70%;
            margin:30px auto;
            background:#ffffff;
            padding:20px;
            border-radius:10px;
            box-shadow:0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        h1{
            color:#d32f2f;
            text-align:center;
        }

        h2{
            color:#333;
        }

        p{
            font-size:18px;
            line-height:1.6;
            color:#555;
        }

        img{
            display:block;
            margin:20px auto;
            width:400px;
            max-width:100%;
            border-radius:8px;
        }

        ul{
            font-size:18px;
            color:#444;
        }

        .btn{
            display:block;
            width:220px;
            margin:30px auto;
            text-align:center;
            background:#28a745;
            color:white;
            text-decoration:none;
            padding:15px;
            font-size:20px;
            border-radius:5px;
        }

        .btn:hover{
            background:#218838;
        }

        .footer{
            text-align:center;
            color:#777;
            margin-top:20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>🔥 Limited Time Offer! 🔥</h1>

    <h2>Introducing the Smart Fitness Watch</h2>

    <img src="product.jpg" alt="Smart Fitness Watch">

    <p>
        Are you ready to improve your health and stay connected at the same time?
        Our <strong>Smart Fitness Watch</strong> helps you track your daily
        activities, monitor your heart rate, and receive smartphone notifications
        right on your wrist.
    </p>

    <h2>Why Choose Our Product?</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>✔ Heart Rate & Sleep Monitoring</li>
        <li>✔ Step & Calorie Counter</li>
        <li>✔ Waterproof Design</li>
        <li>✔ Long Battery Life</li>
        <li>✔ Affordable Price</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        <strong>Special Offer:</strong> Get <span style="color:red;">25% OFF</span>
        when you order today. Don't miss this exclusive deal!
    </p>

    <a href="#" class="btn">Buy Now</a>

    <div class="footer">
        <p>Offer valid while stocks last.</p>
        <p>Contact: info@example.com | +1 234 567 890</p>
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
